import{_ as i,o as t,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 661 | Time Domain and Civilizational Closed Loop | Quest-Domain-Guaranteed Civilizational Depth","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 661 | Time Domain and Civilizational Closed Loop | Quest-Domain-Guaranteed Civilizational Depth","no":661,"module":3,"tags":["Time Domain","Civilizational Depth","Quest Domain","Quest Sediment Domain","Civilizational Development"],"related":["512-Value of Deep Experience","650-Civilizational-Memory Sedimentation","651-Art-and-Philosophy Flourishing"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0661_模块3-时间域与文明闭环-求索域保障的文明深度.md","filePath":"en/0661_模块3-时间域与文明闭环-求索域保障的文明深度.md"}'),o={name:"en/0661_模块3-时间域与文明闭环-求索域保障的文明深度.md"};function s(l,e,r,h,d,u){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-661-time-domain-and-civilizational-closed-loop-quest-domain-guaranteed-civilizational-depth" tabindex="-1">Entry 661 | Time Domain and Civilizational Closed Loop | Quest-Domain-Guaranteed Civilizational Depth <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-661-time-domain-and-civilizational-closed-loop-quest-domain-guaranteed-civilizational-depth" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 661 | Time Domain and Civilizational Closed Loop | Quest-Domain-Guaranteed Civilizational Depth&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Entries 512, 650, 651 | Series: Time Domain and Civilizational Closed Loop (Entry 3)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-civilizational-ascension-without-depth-is-only-a-technology-bubble" tabindex="-1">Introduction: civilizational ascension without depth is only a technology bubble <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-civilizational-ascension-without-depth-is-only-a-technology-bubble" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: civilizational ascension without depth is only a technology bubble&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain drives civilizational ascension (Entry 660), but if there were only the acceleration domain and no Quest Sediment Domain, what would civilization become? It would develop technology rapidly, but spiritually empty; it would iterate extremely fast, but culturally shallow; it would be powerful, but nihilistically meaningless. This &quot;fast but not deep&quot; civilization is a technology bubble — looks prosperous, breaks at a touch. The Quest Sediment Domain&#39;s function is precisely to ensure civilization maintains depth while rapidly ascending.</p><p>Six top-level axioms take effect here: anti-predation axiom requires depth not be built on predation; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires depth cover Myriad Ranks&#39; spirit; collective ascension axiom requires depth serve Myriad Ranks&#39; spiritual growth; causal self-discipline axiom requires deep experience not create trauma; law-first axiom requires the depth-guarantee mechanism&#39;s law definition stable and self-consistent. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. This entry analyzes how the Quest Sediment Domain guarantees civilizational depth.</p><h2 id="i-five-dimensions-of-civilizational-depth" tabindex="-1">I. Five Dimensions of Civilizational Depth <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-five-dimensions-of-civilizational-depth" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Five Dimensions of Civilizational Depth&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_1-1-spiritual-depth-the-thickness-of-life-meaning" tabindex="-1">1.1 Spiritual Depth: The Thickness of Life Meaning <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-spiritual-depth-the-thickness-of-life-meaning" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Spiritual Depth: The Thickness of Life Meaning&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Whether civilization is deep is first seen in its depth of understanding life&#39;s meaning. Meaning-of-life construction in the Quest Domain (Entry 653) ensures Myriad Ranks not only focus on &quot;getting stronger,&quot; but also on &quot;why get stronger.&quot; This spiritual depth is the dimension a technology bubble most lacks.</p><h3 id="_1-2-cultural-depth-the-thickness-of-tradition-and-innovation" tabindex="-1">1.2 Cultural Depth: The Thickness of Tradition and Innovation <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-cultural-depth-the-thickness-of-tradition-and-innovation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Cultural Depth: The Thickness of Tradition and Innovation&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Civilizational depth sees whether culture is rich, whether tradition continues, whether innovation has roots. The cultural-transmission mechanism in the Quest Domain (Entry 646) ensures Myriad Ranks&#39; culture does not break the thread in the accelerating era.</p><h3 id="_1-3-relational-depth-the-thickness-of-trust-among-myriad-ranks" tabindex="-1">1.3 Relational Depth: The Thickness of Trust Among Myriad Ranks <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-relational-depth-the-thickness-of-trust-among-myriad-ranks" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Relational Depth: The Thickness of Trust Among Myriad Ranks&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Civilizational depth sees whether relations among Myriad Ranks are real, whether trust is deep. Interpersonal-relationship deepening in the Quest Domain (Entry 652) ensures Myriad-Rank relations are not functional, but deeply connected.</p><h3 id="_1-4-memory-depth-the-thickness-of-civilizational-history" tabindex="-1">1.4 Memory Depth: The Thickness of Civilizational History <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-4-memory-depth-the-thickness-of-civilizational-history" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.4 Memory Depth: The Thickness of Civilizational History&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Civilizational depth sees whether it truly remembers its own history — including successes and failures. Civilizational-memory sedimentation in the Quest Domain (Entry 650) ensures civilization does not forget where it came from because of too-rapid iteration.</p><h3 id="_1-5-wisdom-depth-the-thickness-of-philosophy-and-art" tabindex="-1">1.5 Wisdom Depth: The Thickness of Philosophy and Art <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-5-wisdom-depth-the-thickness-of-philosophy-and-art" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.5 Wisdom Depth: The Thickness of Philosophy and Art&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Civilizational depth sees whether it has flourishing philosophy and art. Art and philosophy flourishing in the Quest Domain (Entry 651) ensures civilization not only produces technology, but also produces thought and beauty.</p><h2 id="ii-the-quest-domain-s-guarantee-mechanisms-for-civilizational-depth" tabindex="-1">II. The Quest Domain&#39;s Guarantee Mechanisms for Civilizational Depth <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-quest-domain-s-guarantee-mechanisms-for-civilizational-depth" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Quest Domain&#39;s Guarantee Mechanisms for Civilizational Depth&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Depth Dimension</th><th>Quest-Domain Guarantee Method</th><th>Risk Without Quest Domain</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Spiritual depth</td><td>Meaning-of-life construction guidance</td><td>Meaning vacuum after technology bubble</td></tr><tr><td>Cultural depth</td><td>Five cultural-transmission defense lines</td><td>Intergenerational cultural fault</td></tr><tr><td>Relational depth</td><td>Coexistence/conflict/sedimentation three-dimensional relationship education</td><td>Flood of instrumental relations</td></tr><tr><td>Memory depth</td><td>Three-layer memory sedimentation + desensitization mechanism</td><td>Historical reversal repeated</td></tr><tr><td>Wisdom depth</td><td>Art-and-philosophy three-condition guarantee</td><td>Spiritual anemia</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Five dimensions of depth guarantee ensure civilization does not lose its spiritual foundation during the acceleration domain&#39;s hundredfold iteration.</p><h2 id="iii-the-relation-between-depth-and-ascension" tabindex="-1">III. The Relation Between Depth and Ascension <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-relation-between-depth-and-ascension" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Relation Between Depth and Ascension&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Civilizational depth and civilizational ascension are not opposites, but complements:</p><ul><li><strong>Ascension determines how fast civilization may run</strong>: the three layers of technology, institution, spirit determine civilizational-development speed;</li><li><strong>Depth determines how far civilization may run</strong>: the five dimensions of spirit, culture, relation, memory, wisdom determine whether civilization may continuously develop without collapsing.</li></ul><p>Only ascension without depth — the faster civilization runs, the worse it falls (technology bubble); only depth without ascension — civilization runs slowly but does not travel far (stagnant civilization). Dual-track synergy: the acceleration domain manages ascension speed; the Quest domain manages depth guarantee.</p><h2 id="iv-the-relation-between-civilizational-depth-and-historical-reversal" tabindex="-1">IV. The Relation Between Civilizational Depth and Historical Reversal <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-relation-between-civilizational-depth-and-historical-reversal" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Relation Between Civilizational Depth and Historical Reversal&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Insufficient civilizational depth is one of the fundamental reasons for historical reversal. Predatory-faction civilizations repeatedly reverse not only because institutions are unjust, but because the spirit is shallow — Myriad Ranks do not understand ancestors&#39; lessons, do not cherish their own civilizational history, do not identify with the meaning of Myriad-Rank coexistence. The Quest Domain&#39;s five depth dimensions precisely prevent historical reversal at the root:</p><ul><li>Spiritual depth lets Myriad Ranks know why they should not plunder;</li><li>Cultural depth lets Myriad Ranks cherish their own civilizational traditions;</li><li>Relational depth lets Myriad Ranks trust each other rather than attack each other;</li><li>Memory depth lets Myriad Ranks remember historical lessons;</li><li>Wisdom depth lets Myriad Ranks have the ability to cope with new challenges.</li></ul><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the Quest Domain converts seemingly &quot;slow&quot; deep experience into the foundation of civilizational sustainable development — ascension without depth guarantee ultimately wastes on collapse and restart</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: all five dimensions of civilizational depth are built on non-predatory basis — spirit, culture, relation, memory, wisdom are all obtained not by plundering others</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system has technology (cultivation) but no depth — shallow spirit, poor culture, instrumental relations; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Quest domain guarantees five dimensions of civilizational depth</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the five depth dimensions cover all beings of Myriad Ranks; depth is not a few elites&#39; privilege</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the five-dimension depth-guarantee model, guarantee mechanisms, reversal-prevention paths all public; newly merged planes接入 the same depth-guarantee system; the civilizational-depth infrastructure leading to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm may infinitely expand</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain lets civilization ascend; the Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision guarantees depth monitoring; the Quest domain lets civilization be deep. Without Quest-Domain-guaranteed civilizational depth, acceleration-domain-driven ascension is a technology bubble — the faster it runs, the worse it falls. The Quest Sediment Domain guarantees civilizational depth from five dimensions — spirit, culture, relation, memory, wisdom — ensuring civilization does not lose its spiritual foundation while rapidly ascending. <strong>Fast gives civilization power; deep gives civilization confidence; dual-track synergy is fast-and-deep civilizational development</strong>.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./512_模块3-深度体验的价值.html">Entry 512 · Value of Deep Experience</a> · <a href="./650_模块3-求索域深度-求索域中的文明记忆沉淀.html">Entry 650 · Civilizational-Memory Sedimentation</a> · <a href="./651_模块3-求索域深度-求索域中的艺术与哲学繁荣.html">Entry 651 · Art-and-Philosophy Flourishing</a> · <a href="./662_模块3-时间域与文明闭环-双轨协同的文明永续.html">Entry 662 · Dual-Track-Synergized Civilizational Perpetuity</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const m=i(o,[["render",s]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
